  hintId: tutorial_training_11
  isUnlockedByDefault: 0
  ignoreLock: 1
  title: Final Simulation
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: 'We are reaching the final simulation! There are no new programming
    concepts to learn here. Instead, we will put everything you know to the test
    by simulating a real exploration mission.


    Naturally, you want to gather
    the resources with the highest value, right? The objective of this simulation
    is to explore the map and collect the White Ores with the highest values among
    all available ores.


    If your inventory is full, you can simply use the <font="JetBrainsMono
    SDF"><color=#33CC66>discard</color>()</font> command to drop resources that are
    worth less than the new ore in front of you.'
  isImageBig: 0
